goh264 v0.0.0-20260714162114-14b36a2bfcc4, which Clack links for huddle screen shares, is a source-shaped port of
FFmpeg's H.264 decoder at n8.0.1, under the same LGPL-2.1-or-later. goh264's own files
keep only their SPDX id; the FFmpeg files they port carry these copyright lines

